c\\)</span>，真阶段支配定理便使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 5.6.7；印刷页 126；PDF 第 161 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-true-stage-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"4e7ca846b90080b6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-true-stage-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-true-stage-domination","status":"resolved","id":"5c18af15d55babd2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-true-stage-domination]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-shoenfield-limit","status":"resolved","id":"d81dfad676f32c4a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-domination]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-true-stage-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"4e7ca846b90080b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-shoenfield-limit]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-equivalence]]；see [[20-thm-true-stage-domination]]；see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-true-stage-domination","status":"resolved","id":"5c18af15d55babd2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hy